# Aether uses keywords rather than symbolic operators for (preference)

Standing user preference: Aether uses keywords rather than symbolic operators for bitwise logic, to avoid confusion with logical operators.

## Conventions
- Aether uses keywords rather than symbolic operators for bitwise logic, to avoid confusion with logical operators.

